            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A polyolefin porous film is provided having:a basis weight-converted puncture strength of 50 gf/(g/m&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;2&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;) or more;a difference of 15 sec/100 cm&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;3&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; or less between a maximum value and a minimum value of an air permeability measured at a total of three spots along the width direction (TD), which spots consist of two spots at 10% of a full width from the respective ends inward to the center and one central spot; anda pressurized-state air permeability of 140 sec/100 cm&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;3&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; or less at 30°C in a pressurized state of 3 MPa.</p>
            </abstract>
